      "text": "Design multidisciplinary solutions and impart knowledge in planning, engineering design and development of water resources projects involving water supply, irrigation, hydropower, flood control, drainage, water conservation and slurry transport."
    },
    {
      "outcome_id": "PLO2",
      "text": "Evaluate the role of surface water and groundwater resources including snow and glacial water in holistic development through critical assessment of their impact on sustainability."
    },
    {
      "outcome_id": "PLO3",
      "text": "Address dynamic challenges in water resource management to develop resilient and climate-adaptive water systems."
    }
  ],
